// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2064818944" "I have something that needs your attention, {HeroName}. Devouring Earth creatures have been spotted massing in a warehouse. They're trashing the place, but I don't think that's the sum of their plan. There's a good chance that their masters are planning some kind of raid and are using the place as a rally point. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can defeat the Devouring Earth before they can mount a full attack, we could save a lot of people and property.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P878661104" "Defeat the Devouring Earth before they can mount a full attack"
// SendOffString :
"P375073684" "Keep on the lookout for any clues that might explain why the Devouring Earth is attacking that warehouse."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2139641069" "Stop Devouring Earth raid"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1538487166" "I want that raid stopped, {HeroName}! Today!"
// TaskTitle :
"P2530294076" "<color deepskyblue>An Unnatural Order</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2434662756" "From the number of muddy trails tracked through this lobby, you guess the Devouring Earth have a big project going on here."

