// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3499728996" "You have defeated the Devouring Earth and saved many of the Lomad Labs researchers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P224225313" "You did as well as you possibly could, but it sure seems like the Devouring Earth have something against Lomad Labs. That's two strikes they've made against the company so far! I know that you're worried about the scientists those creatures kidnapped, but it's not over yet. Those people may still have a chance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - DevouringE_5_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3644612845" "I got some info on those scientists the Devouring Earth kidnapped from Lomad Labs. One of them was able to get a call out on his cell phone. The police are gathering forces to mount a rescue, but I don't think we have time to wait. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, save those scientists from the Devouring Earth!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P94397453" "Save the scientists from the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P1231318912" "The Devouring Earth moved the scientists into a series of shallow caverns. They're probably waiting for things to quiet down so they can move the scientists to their main habitat out in Eden."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2106512373" "Rescue kidnapped scientists"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2106743240" "You need to rescue all of the missing scientists. Once the Devouring Earth has moved them to Eden, they won't survive for long."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2967923603" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three</color>"

