"P2444535685" "I'm so glad you came when you did. Listen, there's something I need to tell you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P962694311" "You must have got my call! Listen, there's something you need to know!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3893291293" "I thought I'd never see sunlight again!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3770350842" "You have rescued the kidnapped researchers from Lomad Labs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P845335697" "Kidnapped scientists, and now missing mystics too. It seems the Devouring Earth have been busy. I checked around; a French mystic named Raquel Thibodaux did arrive in town last week, but she hasn't been at any of the conferences she came here to attend. We need some way to locate her and any more kidnapped people before it's too late."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - DevouringE_5_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P701121757" "It seems those scientists you rescued were right: the Devouring Earth have kidnapped a lot more people than we had guessed. I've been able to link several missing persons cases to recent Devouring Earth raids. They've been taking mystics from all over the area. Right now, our best chance at finding them is to get information on their movements from some of their enemies. One of the scientists you rescued in the caves mentioned an attack by the Council. There's probably a Council base near those caves. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go to that base and see if they have any information about where the Devouring Earth are taking the kidnapped people.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1061209617" "Seek information in Council base"
// SendOffString :
"P4183669134" "Whatever the Devouring Earth is up to, it's big. Some of the kidnapped were from cities normally outside their range. Let's just hope that the Council's habit for careful record keeping work for us this time."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2339175940" "Seek info at Council base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P429058635" "Check computers, check files, check reports. The Council files everything. All you have to do is find information on the location of the Devouring Earth."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2753106874" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2430721236" "The Council always keeps close tabs on other groups. It's a sure bet that they have info on the Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1944245983" "I hear those beasts are giving {HeroName} a run for the money."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P890182696" "Hah! Good for them!"

