"P363401045" "Raquel Thibodaux, one of the mystics you rescued from the Devouring Earth, just contacted me. She says she's divined the location of the last two people taken by the Devouring Earth. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>With luck, we can still save Dr. Theron and Professor Lovelethe.</A> <br><br>You had better take along some spare emergency teleporters, just in case."
// AcceptString :
"P3111110742" "Save Dr. Theron and Professor Lovelethe"
// SendOffString :
"P2425689049" "Raquel said that this area may contain answers for you, {HeroName}. She was pretty vague about it, but you better keep your eyes peeled."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P67574550" "Rescue missing scientists"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3961410880" "You need to find at least some trace of Dr. Achilles Theron and Professor Augustus P. Lovelethe."
