// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2233487255" "According to that scientist you rescued, Professor Lovelethe, the Devouring Earth plan to release this mutagen of theirs into the sewers. {HeroName}, we may not have much time. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop the Devouring Earth from releasing the Will of the Earth into the water system.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1879678734" "Prevent the Devouring Earth from releasing the Will of the Earth into the water system"
// SendOffString :
"P1602345247" "The mutagen is contained in giant crystal structures. You'll need to destroy all of them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P877997783" "Stop release of mutagen"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P624184324" "The Will of the Earth mutagen is your top priority. Don't worry about anything else."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1776411045" "<color deepskyblue>Part Seven</color>"

