// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2683875881" "Okay. {HeroName}, you've already gone beyond the call of duty to destroy this Devouring Earth mutagen, the Will of the Earth. But it looks like there's more of this stuff out there, and the Devouring Earth might be getting ready to unleash it on the populace. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You need to destroy the Will of the Earth, once and for all.</A> Thankfully, this sample of the mutagen seems to have some sort of telepathic connection to the rest. It should lead you in the right direction."
// AcceptString :
"P1354148719" "Destroy the Will of the Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P3294265321" "It's only a matter of time before the Devouring Earth unleash this mutagen on the city."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2960604021" "I need every last sample of that mutagen under lock and key."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3701972778" "<color deepskyblue>Part Finale</color>"

